e and digital so  this is something that they are going to  discuss here in lugano  okay the outcome of the war is still  unclear at that at this point given that  what can we expect from this conference  well we expect the ukrainian government  to present a national plan how to  implement all of that that we've just  been speaking about  the prime minister of ukraine is here  five of his ministers they are going to  come together with leaders from dozens  of countries and international  institutions of course believing that  this war will be over one day and it  will be then ready to rebuild their  country ozola fonder lion the european  commission president is also going to be  here attend this meeting and he is  expected to promise ukraine that europe  will be with them every step of their  way and she's also expected to  present a platform to coordinate eu  donations uh to mobilize what could  amount to more than 500 billion of euros  alexander thank you very much that was  our brussels bureau chief alexander fun  naman
 

